<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card as strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card as strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Factory Card Outlet Corp with a strong buy rating, with a 12-month price target of $12-to-$13.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 to 9-3/8.</p>
</text>
